x-anti-slop
=============

This extension hides AI-generated slop posts on X while you scroll. The
extension code in this repository is imported from clean-twitter and remains
under that project's MIT license. The copyright notice and permission notice
are in the LICENSE file and must stay with the code.

clean-twitter
-------------

https://github.com/midplane/clean-twitter

Copyright (c) 2026 Nikhil Bafna

Licensed under the MIT License. See the LICENSE file in this repository.

The imported project is a WXT + TypeScript + React extension (Chrome MV3 and
Firefox MV2). It classifies posts with TypeSafe's Jev decision model, reached
either through the TypeSafe API or through OpenRouter with the user's own key.
Verdicts are cached by tweet id. Filtered posts can be collapsed, blurred, or
removed, and collapse/blur leave a Show button.

