unpolish-ai-writing
-------------------

https://github.com/wilu222/unpolish-ai-writing

Copyright (c) 2026 wilu222

Licensed under the MIT License. See LICENSE-third-party.

slop-filter adapted this skill's tell list and word tables. Those tables are
in `lib/detect/stylometry.ts` and the question wording in
`lib/detect/questions.ts`. The skill removes the tells from text. This
extension uses them to spot the tells.
